#: port/frontend/shell/pages.cpp:1290
msgid "Play a game from your 3DS over your network, or set Azahar up from it"
msgstr "Jogue um jogo do seu 3DS pela sua rede, ou configure o Azahar a partir dele"

#: port/frontend/shell/pages.cpp:1306
msgid "3DS address"
msgstr "Endereço do 3DS"

#: port/frontend/shell/pages.cpp:1307
msgid ""
"The address Artic Base shows on the 3DS's screen when it is ready.\n"
"Cross edits it: Left and Right choose a number, Up and Down change it by 1, L1 and R1 by 10, and Cross again keeps it.\n"
"The 3DS and the PS5 must be on the same network."
msgstr ""
"O endereço que o Artic Base mostra na tela do 3DS quando está pronto.\n"
"Cruz o edita: Esquerda e Direita escolhem um número, Cima e Baixo o mudam de 1 em 1, L1 e R1 de 10 em 10, e Cruz de novo o confirma.\n"
"O 3DS e o PS5 precisam estar na mesma rede."

#: port/frontend/shell/pages.cpp:1309
msgid "Connect and play"
msgstr "Conectar e jogar"

#: port/frontend/shell/pages.cpp:1310
msgid ""
"On the 3DS, start the Artic Base app (homebrew, from Azahar's team) and choose a game in it: the cartridge or an installed one. Then connect from here: the game plays on the PS5 from the 3DS, and its saves stay on the 3DS.\n"
"It is only as smooth as the network: a strong Wi-Fi signal for the 3DS and a wired PS5 help."
msgstr ""
"No 3DS, inicie o app Artic Base (homebrew da equipe do Azahar) e escolha um jogo nele: o cartucho ou um instalado. Depois conecte daqui: o jogo roda no PS5 a partir do 3DS, e os saves dele ficam no 3DS.\n"
"Ele só é tão fluido quanto a rede: um sinal de Wi-Fi forte para o 3DS e um PS5 no cabo ajudam."

#: port/frontend/shell/pages.cpp:1313
msgid "Set up from an Old 3DS"
msgstr "Configurar a partir de um 3DS antigo"

#: port/frontend/shell/pages.cpp:1314
msgid ""
"With the Artic Setup Tool app running on an Old 3DS or 2DS: copies its system files and its own data (system settings, friend code, Mii and eShop data) into Azahar, so games that need the 3DS's system applets or files start, and the Home Menu can (Settings > System).\n"
"That data is your console's: do not share Azahar's folder afterwards."
msgstr ""

#: port/frontend/shell/pages.cpp:1317
msgid "Set up from a New 3DS"
msgstr "Configurar a partir de um New 3DS"

#: port/frontend/shell/pages.cpp:1317
msgid "As above, from a New 3DS or New 2DS running the Artic Setup Tool app."
msgstr "Como acima, a partir de um New 3DS ou New 2DS rodando o app Artic Setup Tool."

